				27,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Grove and Vine submodules — Transport reformat and Terminal/SCM/Provider registration\n\n**Grove** (style): Reformat the `connect`, `send`, and `close` method chains in `Source/Transport/Strategy.rs` across all transport variants (gRPC, IPC, WASM, WebSocket). Split `.await` and `.map_err` calls onto separate lines to align with organization formatting standards and improve error-handling clarity.\n\n**Vine** (feat): Expand the `VineHost` trait surface to support native terminal management, SCM provider registration, and normalized language provider dispatch. Implements `TerminalLifecycle` and `WindowCreateTerminal` handlers to bridge Cocoon PTY requests with the native provider and xterm renderer. Adds `RegisterScmProvider` and `RegisterScmResourceGroup` logic to reconstruct URLs from `UriComponents` and manage sequential handles. Introduces a centralized `RegisterLanguageProvider` dispatcher that normalizes 46+ wire method names to standard `TypeName` identifiers before delegating to the embedder registry.\n\nImpact: Extension-driven terminal sessions, SCM viewlet integration, and full VS Code language intelligence features are now supported via the gRPC notification surface.",
			"SHA": "079fec72572b9f69076639dd5be36a63d4619761"
		},
